{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:37:33+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pellet Dodge", "steam_appid": 2474790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2496910], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heads Up</strong>: <i>This game features (or will feature) collaborative music packs included in-game, whether free or paid, that may contain unrated explicit lyrics. These music packs will have an [EXPLICIT] tag when one or more songs contain explicit content.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universe is corrupted. We are the only chance at cleansing it. Ship #404 is missing, which we must urgently find them. Their ShipType's Power CORE could fuel that corruption for eons at double the efficiency if we don't stop it. That's where you come in, #274. Your ShipType is durable enough to not immediately be ripped to shreds by the corrupted. So, to keep it brief; Save #404, stop the corruption, save space. We're all counting on you, #274. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pellet Dodge is a simple, yet challenging game where you <strong>must</strong> save your friend from being used as fuel for the corrupted destruction of the Universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474790/extras/b4dbe262cd9ccb208ec3610ac1574014.avif?t=1793696789\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fly and dash through over 40 levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect coins to upgrade your Ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your ship with an almost endless amount of colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Make your own Custom Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survive for the longest time in Endless Mode, and submit your score to the Online Leaderboards</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heads Up</strong>: <i>This game features (or will feature) collaborative music packs included in-game, whether free or paid, that may contain unrated explicit lyrics. These music packs will have an [EXPLICIT] tag when one or more songs contain explicit content.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Universe is corrupted. We are the only chance at cleansing it. Ship #404 is missing, which we must urgently find them. Their ShipType's Power CORE could fuel that corruption for eons at double the efficiency if we don't stop it. That's where you come in, #274. Your ShipType is durable enough to not immediately be ripped to shreds by the corrupted. So, to keep it brief; Save #404, stop the corruption, save space. We're all counting on you, #274. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pellet Dodge is a simple, yet challenging game where you <strong>must</strong> save your friend from being used as fuel for the corrupted destruction of the Universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474790/extras/b4dbe262cd9ccb208ec3610ac1574014.avif?t=1793696789\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fly and dash through over 40 levels! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Collect coins to upgrade your Ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your ship with an almost endless amount of colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Make your own Custom Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Survive for the longest time in Endless Mode, and submit your score to the Online Leaderboards</p>", "short_description": "Save your friend from being used as a fuel source to corrupt the Universe.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474790/header.jpg?t=1793696789", "capsule_image": "https